# Accepted-risk / unfixable CVE allowlist for image vulnerability scanning.
# Every entry needs a comment directly above it with a reason and a
# review-by date, so an accepted risk from months ago doesn't sit here
# silently forever. Format:
#
# # <CVE-ID> - <why it's accepted> - review by YYYY-MM-DD
# CVE-XXXX-XXXXX
#
# Currently empty - nothing has needed an exception yet. CI (see
# .github/workflows/ci.yml) fails on fixable CRITICAL findings; unfixed CVEs
# are already excluded via --ignore-unfixed rather than needing an entry here.
